<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the MIB 30 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the MIB 30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the MIB 30 index, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAY.97-07.JUL.98   PAYDATE	12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 2000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  18,565 (O6.MAY.97)    ITL/FRF 0.0034</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     21000     4.65 FRF  20.48 PCT  13.6 X</p>
<p> CALL     19000     7.65 FRF  14.46 PCT  8.30 X</p>
<p> PUT	19000     7.87 FRF  -10.12 PCT 8.00 X</p>
<p> PUT	17000     4.30 FRF  -15.24 PCT 14.7 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
